    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατ-οπτρίζομαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, aor. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίξασθαι</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			4.951.64
		</span></i> (Epid.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>look
				at oneself as in a mirror</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ
				ὕδωρ</span> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκάνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					3.30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>contemplate as in a mirror</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς τέχνης ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.Byz.
					<u>Mir.Praef.</u>
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατ-ορύσσω</span></b> , 
				Att.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκάτ-ττω</span></b> , <i>bury in</i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκατωρύχθαι τὴν ψυχὴν ἐν τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					6.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				6.189c
			</span></i>.</div>
